#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:2
msgid "部署实践：用Ferrinx服务模型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{ref}`serving-"
"architecture`中我们讨论了模型服务的架构设计——推理模式、部署拓扑、API设计、认证安全、模型路由。现在我们把理论变成实践：用Ferrinx把{ref"
"}`onnx-export`导出的LeNet模型（如果你做了{ref}`model-"
"optimization`，就是优化后的版本）部署成一个真正的API服务。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"这一节的操作流程和{doc}`../pytorch-practice/using-"
"framework`中框架的使用思路一致：先了解工具的基本用法，然后通过实际操作来掌握各项功能。不同的是，这里的工具不是用来训练模型，而是用来服务模型。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:8
msgid "编译与启动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:10
msgid "Ferrinx是一个Rust项目，在项目目录的`ferrinx-main/`下。首次使用需要编译："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:12
msgid ""
"# 编译所有二进制\n"
"cd ferrinx-main\n"
"cargo build --release\n"
"\n"
"# 编译产物\n"
"# ./target/release/ferrinx-api   - API服务器\n"
"# ./target/release/ferrinx-worker - 推理Worker\n"
"# ./target/release/ferrinx       - CLI客户端\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:23
msgid "编译完成后，用最简单模式启动——不需要Redis，不需要PostgreSQL，一个二进制加一个SQLite文件就够了："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:25
msgid ""
"# 启动API服务器（SQLite自动创建）\n"
"./target/release/ferrinx-api\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:30
msgid "服务默认监听`127.0.0.1:8080`。访问`http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health`可以看到健康检查响应。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:32
msgid "ONNX Runtime的链接方式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:35
msgid ""
"Ferrinx默认使用静态链接（`download-binaries`特性），编译时会自动下载预编译的ONNX "
"Runtime库。如果你的系统glibc版本较旧（Debian 13以下、Ubuntu 24.04以下），需要改用动态链接模式："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:37
msgid "cargo build --release --features load-dynamic\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:41
msgid "同时需要自行安装ONNX Runtime动态库，并在配置文件中指定路径："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:43
msgid ""
"[onnx]\n"
"dynamic_lib_path = \"/usr/local/lib/libonnxruntime.so\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:49
msgid "配置文件"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:51
msgid "Ferrinx的配置文件采用TOML格式。在`config.example.toml`的基础上修改即可。最简配置只需要指定数据库后端为SQLite："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:53
msgid ""
"[server]\n"
"host = \"0.0.0.0\"\n"
"port = 8080\n"
"sync_inference_concurrency = 4\n"
"sync_inference_timeout = 30\n"
"\n"
"[database]\n"
"backend = \"sqlite\"\n"
"url = \"sqlite://./data/ferrinx.db\"\n"
"\n"
"[storage]\n"
"backend = \"local\"\n"
"path = \"./models\"\n"
"\n"
"[onnx]\n"
"cache_size = 5\n"
"execution_provider = \"CPU\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:73
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"各配置项的含义和{doc}`../pytorch-practice/best-"
"practices`中讨论的\"配置管理\"理念相通——将可变参数从代码中分离出来，让部署者可以根据环境灵活调整。例如，`sync_inference_concurrency`控制同时有多少个推理请求可以并发执行，在CPU核心多的机器上可以调大这个值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:75
msgid "初始化系统"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:77
msgid "系统首次启动后，需要执行Bootstrap操作——创建第一个管理员用户并生成API Key。Ferrinx有CLI和curl两种方式完成这个步骤。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:79
msgid "CLI方式（推荐）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:80
msgid "./target/release/ferrinx bootstrap\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:84
msgid "这个命令会自动创建admin用户，生成API Key并保存到本地配置文件。第一次输出的密码是系统自动生成的安全随机密码——只会显示一次，请及时保存。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:86
msgid "curl方式："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:87
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# Bootstrap\n"
"curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bootstrap \\\n"
"  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n"
"  -d '{}'\n"
"\n"
"# 设置API Key环境变量\n"
"export FERRINX_API_KEY=\"frx_sk_...\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:97
msgid "模型注册"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:99
msgid ""
"有了API "
"Key，就可以注册模型了。Ferrinx支持两种注册方式：一种是模型文件在服务端本地，通过配置文件直接注册；另一种是模型文件在客户端，通过上传接口提交。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:101
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"对于本地有模型文件的情况，使用`model register`命令，通过{ref}`onnx-"
"export`中编写的`model.toml`配置文件来注册："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:103
msgid ""
"./target/release/ferrinx model register \\\n"
"  --model-config ./models/lenet-mnist/model.toml\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:108
msgid "Ferrinx会读取配置文件中的元信息、模型路径、预处理/后处理流水线和标签映射，自动注册模型并验证其有效性。注册成功后返回模型的UUID，后续推理调用需要用到这个ID。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:110
msgid "如果模型文件在另一台机器上，使用`upload`命令上传："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:112
msgid ""
"./target/release/ferrinx model upload ./lenet_mnist.onnx \\\n"
"  --name lenet-mnist \\\n"
"  --version 1.0\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:118
msgid "上传完成后，用`model list`查看已注册的模型列表："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:120
msgid "./target/release/ferrinx model list\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:124
msgid "你应该能看到刚刚注册的LeNet模型，状态为valid，代表模型通过了验证。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:126
msgid "模型验证的两层检查"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:129
msgid ""
"Ferrinx在注册模型时会做两层验证。第一层检查ONNX文件的魔数（Magic "
"Number，文件头是否合法），第二层尝试解析模型的输入输出元信息，提取层名、形状和数据类型。这些元信息会被保存，后续推理时用于自动匹配输入。可选的第三层验证会创建ONNX推理会话（Session）来确认模型可执行，在`model_validation.validate_session"
" = true`时启用——这个选项会显著增加注册时间。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:132
msgid "执行推理"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:134
msgid "模型注册完成后，下面来调用推理。最简单的验证方式是使用CLI的同步推理命令："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:136
msgid ""
"# 通过模型名和版本指定模型\n"
"./target/release/ferrinx infer sync \\\n"
"  --name lenet-mnist --version 1.0 \\\n"
"  --image ./path/to/digit.png\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:143
msgid "CLI会自动对图片做预处理（根据model.toml中的配置，缩放→灰度→归一化→转张量），发送推理请求，并解析返回结果："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:145
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"result\": {\n"
"    \"class_index\": 3,\n"
"    \"label\": \"3\",\n"
"    \"probability\": 0.9898\n"
"  },\n"
"  \"latency_ms\": 10\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:156
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"如果要处理批量请求或集成到其他系统，可以直接调用REST API。Python客户端的写法在{doc}`onnx-"
"export`中已经给出，关键步骤是：将输入数据编码为Tensor格式（dtype + shape + "
"base64），构造HTTP请求，带上API Key认证头，发送到`/api/v1/inference/sync`端点。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:158
msgid "对于需要较长时间处理的大模型，使用异步推理："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:160
msgid ""
"# 提交异步推理任务\n"
"./target/release/ferrinx infer async \\\n"
"  --name lenet-mnist --version 1.0 \\\n"
"  --image ./path/to/digit.png\n"
"\n"
"# 查询任务状态\n"
"./target/release/ferrinx task status <task-id>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:170
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"异步推理返回一个task_id，客户端可以轮询这个ID来获取结果。在{ref}`serving-"
"architecture`中讨论过，异步推理依赖Redis——如果没有配置Redis，异步推理端点会返回503。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:172
msgid "配置执行提供者"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:174
msgid "如果你的机器有GPU，可以通过配置执行提供者来加速推理。Ferrinx支持CPU、CUDA、CoreML、ROCm、WebGPU等多种后端，在配置文件中指定即可："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:176
msgid ""
"[onnx]\n"
"execution_provider = \"CUDA\"    # 可选: CPU, CUDA, CoreML, ROCm, WEBGPU\n"
"gpu_device_id = 0\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:182
msgid "不同的执行提供者需要启用不同的编译特性（Feature）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:183
msgid "WebGPU：`cargo build --release --features webgpu`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:184
msgid "CUDA：`cargo build --release --features cuda`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:185
msgid "CoreML：`cargo build --release --features coreml`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:187
msgid "GPU配置的注意事项"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:190
msgid ""
"编译时启用的编译特性（Feature）必须和配置文件中的`execution_provider`一致。如果在配置中设置了CUDA但编译时没有启用cuda"
" "
"feature，Ferrinx会在启动时报错。WebGPU是推荐的GPU加速选项——它通过Vulkan/DirectX/Metal适配各类GPU，不需要安装CUDA"
" Toolkit。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:193
msgid "API Key管理"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:195
msgid "生产环境中，不同的客户端需要使用不同的API Key，而不是所有客户端共享bootstrap生成的管理员Key。创建新的API Key："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:197
msgid ""
"# 创建一个永久Key，带默认用户权限\n"
"./target/release/ferrinx api-keys create \\\n"
"  --name \"my-app-key\"\n"
"\n"
"# 创建一个30天后过期的Key\n"
"./target/release/ferrinx api-keys create \\\n"
"  --name \"trial-key\" \\\n"
"  --expires-days 30\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:208
msgid "创建时返回的Key明文只会显示一次，请立即保存。查看和管理已有的Key："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:210
msgid ""
"# 列出所有Key\n"
"./target/release/ferrinx api-keys list\n"
"\n"
"# 撤销某个Key\n"
"./target/release/ferrinx api-keys revoke <key-id>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:218
msgid "部署到生产环境的建议"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:220
msgid "从开发环境到生产环境，有几个关键的配置调整值得注意。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:222
msgid "第一，**数据库切换**。开发时SQLite很方便，但生产环境面对多实例部署，应该切换到PostgreSQL。配置文件中修改`[database]`段即可，Ferrinx的Repository抽象层确保业务代码不需要修改。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:224
msgid "第二，**日志配置**。开发时日志格式为text方便阅读，生产环境应该改为json格式，便于日志收集系统（如ELK）解析。同时配置日志文件轮转，避免磁盘被日志填满。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:226
msgid ""
"[logging]\n"
"level = \"info\"\n"
"format = \"json\"\n"
"file = \"./logs/ferrinx.log\"\n"
"max_file_size_mb = 100\n"
"max_files = 10\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:235
msgid ""
"第三，**安全增强**。确保API使用HTTPS（在反向代理如Nginx层面配置TLS），设置合理的限流参数，定期轮换API "
"Key。Bootstrap接口在生产环境中应该在完成初始化后禁用（Ferrinx在已有用户时会自动拒绝bootstrap请求）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:237
msgid "第四，**监控部署**。Ferrinx暴露了`/api/v1/metrics`端点和基本的健康检查接口，可以接入Prometheus等监控系统。Worker的健康状况可以通过Redis心跳监测，长时间无心跳的Worker说明需要人工介入。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:239
msgid "从开发到生产的检查清单"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:242
msgid "将数据库从SQLite切换为PostgreSQL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:243
msgid "配置HTTPS（反向代理层面）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:244
msgid "设置合理的限流参数"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:245
msgid "创建独立的生产API Key，不要使用bootstrap Key"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:246
msgid "配置日志输出为JSON格式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:247
msgid "启用模型预热（`[onnx].preload`）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:248
msgid "部署监控告警"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:249
msgid "制定备份和恢复策略"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:252
msgid "从框架到Ferrinx的一体化流程"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:254
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"现在回顾整条链路：从PyTorch代码开始（{doc}`../pytorch-practice/index`），经过模型设计和训练（{doc"
"}`../cnn-expedition/practice-peak/index`），用消融实验验证（{doc}`../cnn-expedition"
"/ablation-study/index`），导出为ONNX格式（{doc}`onnx-export`），做量化和剪枝优化（{doc"
"}`model-optimization`），最后部署到Ferrinx服务（本节）——一条完整的\"从研究到生产\"的管线就这样建立起来了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:256
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"这种端到端的视角是理解深度学习工程化的关键。每一章学的技能不是孤立的，它们构成了一个完整的工具链：PyTorch让你能做实验，消融研究让你能验证设计，ONNX解决了格式壁垒，量化和剪枝让模型适配生产环境，Ferrinx解决了部署问题。下一节{doc"
"}`the-end`我们来回顾整条链路，并讨论未来可以深入的方向。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:260
msgid "参与到社团项目的开发"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:262
msgid "Ferrinx 是UCS 深度学习社维护的开源项目，欢迎你贡献代码、报告问题或提出改进建议："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:264
msgid ""
"[github.com/ulink-deep-learning-club/ferrinx](https://github.com/ulink-"
"deep-learning-club/ferrinx)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/model-serving/deployment-practice.md:266
msgid "**贡献的方式很简单**：发现问题 → 提 Issue → 讨论方案 → 提交 PR。即使只是修正一个文档错别字，也是对社区有意义的贡献。"
msgstr ""

